# Vincent Valentine (CR 603.2, 700.4, 608.2h): two creatures an opponent controls die at once to Pyroclasm, so the ability triggers twice and
# each resolution puts counters equal to that creature's power: two Raging Goblins (1/1) give two counters. Bot1 saves Vincent with Giant
# Growth in response (2/2 becomes 5/5 and survives Pyroclasm's 2 damage), so it ends as a 7/7 (4/4 with two counters, +3/+3 until end of turn).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Vincent Valentine
Giant Growth
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Raging Goblin
Raging Goblin
Pyroclasm
Mountain x20

